{"id":3777,"imdb":"tt0050613","en":"Throne of Blood","orig":"蜘蛛巣城","ar":"عرش الدم","tag":null,"ov":"\"عرش الدم\": فيلم ياباني من عام 1957 أخرجه أكيرا كوروساوا. الفيلم هو اقتباس حر لمسرحية \"ماكبث\" لشكسبير، لكنه ينقل الأحداث إلى اليابان الإقطاعية. الفيلم يتبع قصة الجنرال تاكيتوكي واشيزو، الذي يتآمر لاغتيال زعيمه بعد تلقيه نبوءة من ساحرة. الشك والطموح والخيانة: كلها عناصر قوية تشكل قلب هذا الفيلم الكلاسيكي.","rd":"1957-01-15","rt":108,"g":[18,36],"lang":"ja","budget":0,"revenue":13422,"companies":[{"n":"TOHO","logo":"/fRSWWjquvzcHjACbtF53utZFIll.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Kurosawa Production","logo":null,"c":"JP"}],"countries":["JP"],"langs":["Japanese"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"DE","d":"1957-01-15"},{"c":"JP","d":"1957-01-15"},{"c":"US","d":"1957-01-15"},{"c":"GB","d":"1958-01-06"},{"c":"IT","d":"1959-10-09"},{"c":"DK","d":"1965-10-01"},{"c":"FR","d":"1966-04-27"},{"c":"KR","d":"2004-04-16"},{"c":"NL","d":"2005-03-15"},{"c":"CZ","d":"2008-11-23"},{"c":"PH","d":"2010-09-14"},{"c":"AU","d":"2024-10-26"}],"dir":["Akira Kurosawa"],"prod":["Akira Kurosawa","Sōjirō Motoki"],"wri":["Shinobu Hashimoto","Ryuzo Kikushima","Akira Kurosawa","Hideo Oguni"],"mus":["Masaru Satō"],"dop":["Asakazu Nakai"],"cast":[{"n":"Toshirō Mifune","ch":"Taketoki Washizu","p":"/cZ5ybA7cDA0EBMaM5jX2f7RNBVb.jpg"},{"n":"Isuzu Yamada","ch":"Lady Asaji Washizu","p":"/3b029DnOGOGBCj9rzg8RQFfYPHw.jpg"},{"n":"Takashi Shimura","ch":"Noriyasu Odagura","p":"/ydyAm2vyBbEPZRICIMqqjDm0NM9.jpg"},{"n":"Akira Kubo","ch":"Yoshiteru Miki","p":"/UkFbxpKAuLslwX0d3J2eFGdiae.jpg"},{"n":"Hiroshi Tachikawa","ch":"Kunimaru Tsuzuki","p":"/hBbv13LAOe8apqS1l5oXo36Vez8.jpg"},{"n":"Minoru Chiaki","ch":"Yoshiaki Miki","p":"/9E3efYEg8pxANdfVLqYGiX8zJE8.jpg"},{"n":"Takamaru Sasaki","ch":"Kuniharu Tsuzuki","p":"/A2Z5wU2CYGSPrRgESpwnzISGhx0.jpg"},{"n":"Gen Shimizu","ch":"Washizu samurai","p":"/j8cTqUE8RbrqwO5VUE2oZvDHgWn.jpg"},{"n":"Kokuten Kōdō","ch":"Military Commander","p":"/yYtoQtEf3QntzWC7XRQeJQeGp52.jpg"},{"n":"Kichijirō Ueda","ch":